    entry_requirements = '<div aria-expanded="true" class="w-tabs-section-content" id="content-1645436172457-11d7648a-954d" style=""><div class="w-tabs-section-content-h i-cf"><div class="wpb_text_column taab active"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><p>Skyline International College (SIC) follows the SIT Training package guidance for the entry requirements for this qualification.<br/> There are no entry requirements for this qualification and direct entry is accepted.</p> <h4>Academic Requirements:</h4> <p>Minimum completion of Australian Year 11 secondary school education equivalent or above. This requirement will vary by country of origin and information is provided on the SIC website and SIC marketing materials.</p> <h4>English Language Requirements:</h4> <p class="cvgsua" style="text-align: justify;"><span class="agcmg">Academic IELTS 6.0 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each band or Upper Intermediate or EAP completion from an approved ELICOS/ESL centre Or Equivalent English Test (e.g. PTE, TOEFL).</span></p> <p class="cvgsua" style="text-align: justify; color: rgba(35,31,32,var(--o42jjq,1)); caret-color: #231f20; --8sd0kg: none; --cyv3zq: 12px; --gjplxq: 1.985; --s8nbea: p;"><span style="color: rgba(35,31,32,var(--o42jjq,1)); caret-color: #231f20; --ys-xuq: none; font-kerning: none;"><span class="agcmg">An AQF qualification at Certificate III level or above in any discipline,</span> delivered and assessed in English, will also satisfy both academic and</span> English requirements.</p> <p class="cvgsua" style="text-align: justify;"><span class="agcmg">Successfully complete the Language, Literacy, and Numeracy (LLN) and Digital literacy assessment provided by SIC prior to finalization of enrolment.</span></p> </div></div></div></div>',
